<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edged up to 4.6575 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edged up to 4.6575 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.6575 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.659 on March 17.</p>
<p>				   Mar 18	Mar 17</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.6575	4.6590</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   550,000     100,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
